                    "availability": "supported",
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "%1:%2",
                    "context": "Format of one displayed key/action pair: %1=resolved key label, %2=action text such as Select. Example \"%1: %2\". Drawn with drawTextEx, so supported text escapes are expanded. Empty key or action text skips the slot."
